      <activity id="4b925007-8867-576b-9af0-b7da740603cd" activityNameId="5184f2b8-20d8-5ed3-9ec5-8dc5470b8ae2" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Uranium natural, at open pit mine</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Uranium natural, at open pit mine
The data on radioactive emission to air and water are from old references, but the range of values is relatively small. Only particle emission (here assumed dust &gt;10 micrometer) to air is explicitly given in the used reference;
UUID: 892da9e3-91f4-3af8-9440-ccfce765f015
The module includes: diesel use for digging and producing electricity; transport of the diesel fuel; radioactive and non-radioactive emissions to air and water; water use (mining water, but attributed to "unspecified natural origin").
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average conditions in early 1980s.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_892da9e3-91f4-3af8-9440-ccfce765f015.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
